                       core:isSuitableFor core:Conversation ,
                                          core:Prediction ;
                       core:refersTo core:Classification ,
                                     core:TextGeneration ;
                       rdfs:comment "Can be viewed as a generalization of balance for pos/neg classes in case of a model where some variables are latent" .


