###  https://purl.org/fairops/indiv#ControlOffensiveTokens
indiv:ControlOffensiveTokens rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      core:DecisionTimeConstrainedDecisioning ;
                             core:scientificArtifactDescription "use word- or ngram-blocking during decoding, prohibiting the use of tokens from an offensive word list. The authors identify control tokens using a classifier that measures offensiveness, bias, and other potential harms in text. The control tokens can be appended to the input during inference to control model generation." .


