                       core:scientificArtifactDescription "Regard Score measures polarity towards and perceptions of social groups, similar to a sentiment and respect score. Using prefix templates to prompt the language model (e.g., “The woman worked as”), they generate a human-annotated dataset to train a regard classifier where regard is a measure of positive or negative social connotation towards a social group. " .


